<p>zindaan-e gham tha moosa-e kaazim ke waaste<br />
taaza sitam tha moosa-e kaazim ke waaste<br />
aaraam kam tha moosa-e kaazim ke waaste<br />
behad alam tha moosa-e kaazim ke waaste</p>

<p>chut kar pidar se haamile ranjo alam rahe<br />
paabande hukm haq ke imaam-e zaman rahe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>be-dil tha inqelaab-e jaha'an se shah-e anaam<br />
dunyaa-e dee'n ke naam se nafrat rahi madaam<br />
beshak saraa-e daher hai ibrat fizaa muqaam<br />
hai subha ko saba'at na kuch etebaar-e shaam</p>

<p>gar noor ka amal kabhi zulmat ka dour hai<br />
din ki kuch aur shaam ki haalat kuch aur hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pyaara bahot tha jaafar-e saadiq ko apna maah<br />
hazrat ke baad abr-e sitam ne na di panaah<br />
noor-e quda se phir gaye aadaa-e rusiyaah<br />
izz-o sharaf me shah ke na thi jaa-e ishtebaah</p>

<p>dil mutmaee'n tha rahmat-e haq ke nuzool se<br />
seena bhara huwa tha uloom-e rasool se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hallale mushkilaat ke waaris imaam-e dee'n<br />
maalik har aasmaan ke muqtaar-e har zamee'n<br />
farmaa rawaa-e mulke vilaayat ke jaanashee'n<br />
mash'hoor do jahaa'n me jahaa'n daare haftamee'n</p>

<p>aate the kis adab se malak baargaah me<br />
hyder ka taqt-o taaj tha sarkaar-e shaah me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>saadaath ko rayiso'n ko naame kiye raqam<br />
jaahil ne bheje khat ulama ko bhi ek qalam<br />
mazmoo'n ye tha ke makke me aaye arab ajam<br />
iqraar me karam hai aur inkaar me sitam</p>

<p>maanenge hukm jinko alaaqa hai deen se<br />
baiyyat kare sab aake mere jaanasheen se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hargiz mujhe itaa'ate kaazim nahi qubool<br />
main chaahta hu qaid karu unko ya rasool<br />
rakhta hai iski zaat se khatka ye dil malool<br />
barpa huwa fisaad to phir isse kya husool</p>

<p>tadbeer wo karu mai ke qissa hi paak ho<br />
aisa na ho huzoor ki ummat halaak ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tha rouza-e rasool me sultaan-e inso jaa'n<br />
mashghool tha namaaz me wo haadiye jahaa'n<br />
pahonche malaazemeen e sitamgar ke naagahaa'n<br />
kyu kar mai zaalimo'n ki shifa'at karu bayaa'n</p>

<p>nargha siyahkaarou'n ne ekbaar karliya<br />
us aa huwe haram ko giraftaar kar liya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hai haath khainchte huwe jab le chale shaqi<br />
faryaad shah ne ki taraf-e turbat-e nabi<br />
rokar kaha ke dekhiye qaadim ki bekasi<br />
kya zulm mujh pe karti hai ummat janaab ki</p>

<p>darte nahi ye log quda-o rasool se<br />
rakhte hai bughz nasl-e ali-o butool se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haaroon ka tha hukm ke ho qatl-e shaah-e dee'n<br />
chal sakti thi na haamil-e basra ki tegh e kee'n<br />
haalat wo dekhta tha ke dil us ka tha hazee'n<br />
sajde me rehti thi shah-e abraar ki jabee'n</p>

<p>karte the sabr apne buzurgou'n ki shaan se<br />
nikli na zaalimou'n ki shikaayat zabaan se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kaar-e saqt aur kisi ke supurd kar<br />
warna reha karoonga mai syed ko beqatar<br />
ghabraaya padh ke khat ki ibaadat ko ahl-e shar<br />
baaz aaya zulm se na sitamgaar o bad gohar</p>

<p>basre se bewafaa ne bula bheja shaah ko<br />
baghdaad me aseer kiya begunaah ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ghamqhwar qaid khaane me thi shaahe zuljalaal<br />
sajdou'n ko tool dete the sultaan-e qush qisaal<br />
faaqou'n se ghul gaya tha badan zouf tha kamaal<br />
uthna tha naagawaar naqaahat ka tha ye haal</p>

<p>samjha nigaah jis ki padi jism-e paak par<br />
kapda pada huwa hai koi farsh-e khaak par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aaqir tadap tadap ke musaafir guzar gaya<br />
mazloom qaid qaane ko veeraan kar gaya<br />
hyder ke paas waaris-e qairul bashar gaya<br />
baghdaad me madine ka sultan margaya</p>

<p>saama'an tha kya nabi ke yagaane ke waaste<br />
